Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 09:30:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD reviewed-feature acknowledgement so completed patch
 chats close cleanly

Clean review results prompt the patch chat for a yes/no completion acknowledgement so users explicitly close finished feature work. The terminal derives hidden and reopened row state from the chat transcript, which keeps reviewer rows visible and preserves repeated review-cycle acknowledgements.
